{
  "version": "1",
  "text": "You're wearing a shimmering purple sequin dress that catches the light, layered under a chic brown cropped blazer for warmth against the frost. A grey sequined headpiece with a delicate veil adds festive sparkle to your hair, while silver Linea earrings give you a subtle metallic edge without competing with the dress's shine. Burgundy suede boots add height and texture that complement your rich palette perfectly. The red bag offers a bold pop of color that ties into the festive theme, while the plaid wool coat in black and rose provides structure for moving between the restaurant's warmth and the cold night air.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Start with just the purple sequin dress when you arrive to make an immediate statement",
    "Layer the brown blazer on over your shoulders or button it up once you enter the restaurant for that perfect smart-to-formal transition",
    "Pull the grey headpiece down fully if you want a more dramatic look, or keep it perched high for elegance"
  ],
  "wrong_photos": [],
  "swap": {
    "item": "",
    "why": "",
    "to": ""
  },
  "named": [],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#263·01",
      "text": "This long purple sequin dress features a high neckline and flows to your ankles with a beautiful shimmer that catches the light. The fabric is lightweight and drapes elegantly around your figure, creating a sophisticated silhouette perfect for evening occasions."
    },
    {
      "n": "#474·31",
      "text": "Your brown cropped blazer has a modern collar and is designed to be worn open or buttoned. The rich chocolate color provides a grounding element that complements the sparkle of your dress while keeping the look contemporary."
    },
    {
      "n": "#59·15",
      "text": "This grey headpiece combines fine sequins with a delicate veil that frames your face beautifully. The shimmering dots create texture without overwhelming your features, adding just the right amount of festive detail to complete your look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#549·16",
      "text": "These silver Linea earrings feature a sleek, minimalist design that provides a touch of sophistication without competing with your dress's sparkle. They give you an elegant metallic accent that complements the gold and silver tones in your overall palette."
    },
    {
      "n": "#20·10",
      "text": "Your burgundy suede boots add height and texture to your outfit while providing both comfort and style for moving through the restaurant. The pointed toe elongates your legs and the rich color works beautifully with your purple dress."
    },
    {
      "n": "#90·06",
      "text": "This red bag features a clean geometric shape with an elegant metallic clasp that adds a touch of sophistication. The bold color creates a striking contrast against your purple dress while perfectly complementing the festive atmosphere of your New Year's celebration."
    },
    {
      "n": "#484·01",
      "text": "The grey plaid coat in black and rose tones provides structure and warmth for when you need to step outside. The classic check pattern adds visual interest while the neutral base colors ensure it doesn't clash with your outfit's vibrant elements."
    }
  ]
}
